# Kanban Review QA and Done lessons

Applies when working on any card under `.devtool/features/` during **Review** or when the user closes a card.

Full workflow: [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § User-reported QA fixes, § Card Done — lessons learned.

## User-reported QA fixes (mandatory)

When the user reports a **Review** issue and you fix it:

| Card `labels` | Append dated record under |
| ------------- | ------------------------- |
| `bug` | **`## Corrective Action`** |
| feature (default), `agent` | **`## Decisions`** |

Format: `**QA follow-up (YYYY-MM-DD):**` symptom → fix → test/doc pointer. When scope changed, note
**Scope:** appended Product / Tests / Docs (or `none` if card already complete).

**Same turn — refresh card scope** (mandatory when the fix changes code):

1. **`## Feature Areas`** — append product-area label(s) when fix crosses into an area not listed.
2. **`## Product Paths`** — append edited/added product paths not already on the card (dedupe).
3. **`## Product Methods`** — append `path` — `symbol` bullets for new handlers or helpers.
4. **`## Tests`** — append test files and `test_*` methods.
5. **`## Docs`** — append doc paths + § hints when user docs changed.
6. **`docs/feature-areas.yaml`** — when new paths/handlers are durable for that area.

- Bump card `modified` in the **same turn** as the fix.
- Do **not** rely on chat history as the only record.
- **Settings modals:** menu toggle text and tooltips must match modal checkbox labels (fc3b: **HUD Panel**
  ↔ **Show HUD panel**) — Signature: `floating-camera-fc3b-hud-settings`.

